Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:22.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:29.63,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《巴斯克维尔的猎犬》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.56,0:02:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卖报 卖报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Paper, paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:02:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你对它有什么看法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What do you make of it Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.35,0:03:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你后脑勺上一定长眼睛了吧 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I believe you got eyes in the back of your head Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我眼前放着一个擦得锃亮的咖啡壶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well I have a well-polished coffee pot in front of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森太太说是昨晚你出门时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Hudson said it was left last night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人落下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}while you were out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对它有什么看法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What do you make of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少我们知道了他的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}his name at least we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为 摩梯末医生是一位功成名就{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I think Dr. Mortimer is a successful, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年岁较大的杏林人士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}elderly medical man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受人尊敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}well esteemed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}认识他的人们送给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}since those who know him gave him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这件表示感激的纪念品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}this mark of their appreciation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还认为他是位乡村医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I think he's a country practitioner, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出诊时大多是步行的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}does a good deal of his visiting on foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}“CCH的朋友们”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}"Friends of the C.C.H."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜可能是当地的猎人会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I should guess that to be the local hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦好啊 好极了 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh bravo, bravo Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 我不能不说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You know I am bound to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.77,0:04:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经习惯性地低估自己的能力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you habitually underrate your abilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.01,0:04:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你本身并不能发光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It may be that you are not yourself luminous, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你是光的传导者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but you are a conductor of light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些人本身并不是天才{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Some people without possessing genius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却有着可观的激发天才的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}have remarkable power for stimulating it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.37,0:04:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得说 我亲爱的伙伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I confess, my dear fellow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真是太感谢你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that I am very much in your debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 我恐怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But I'm afraid that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的大多数结论都是错误的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}most of your conclusions were erroneous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「H」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}"H"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.87,0:04:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定指的是「医院」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Surely hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.79,0:04:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「CC」应该是查林十字会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}"C.C." suggests Charing Cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我的推理中 这是一个年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I mean if so I would postulate a young man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不到三十岁 和蔼可亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}under thirty, amiable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做事马马虎虎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}absent-minded, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不追求功名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}unambitious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还养了一条狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the possessor of a dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:04:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能给我看看手杖吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Can I see the stick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}养的狗比梗犬大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Larger than a terrier, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比獒犬要小{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}smaller than a mastiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.49,0:05:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一只卷毛的斯班尼犬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a curly haired spaniel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摩梯末医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dr. Mortimer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太感谢您了 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢肯定是把它落在了这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I wasn't sure whether I left it here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.71,0:05:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是忘在了轮渡公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}or at the shipping office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}S.S.直布罗陀号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The S. S. Gibraltar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.56,0:05:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天到了特伯利的码头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you see docks today at Tewberry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对您很感兴趣 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You interest me very much, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真想不到会看见如此长的头骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I had hardly expected so dolichocephalic a skull{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和这么深陷的眼窝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}or such well-marked supra-orbital development.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您不反对我用手指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Would you have any objection to my running{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沿着您的头顶骨缝摸一摸吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}my finger along your parietal fissure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得了吧 摩梯末医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Please Dr. Mortimer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在没有得到您头骨的实物之前 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A cast of your skull, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果能拥有它的模型该多好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}until the original becomes available.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.69,0:06:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并不想讨人厌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is not my intention to be fulsome, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我得承认 我实在很觊觎您的头骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I confess that I covet your skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您还是乖乖坐下吧 摩梯末医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Behave and sit down Dr. Mortimer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我想您今天赏光来贝克街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well I presume that it was not your phrenological passion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.53,0:06:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕不是为了研究我的头骨吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which drew you to Baker Street?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.65,0:06:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可惜 确实不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Unfortunately it was not sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斑斑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.53,0:06:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这里有一份传说的手稿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have here the statement of a certain legend, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在巴斯克维尔家族流传着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which runs in the Baskerville family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴斯克维尔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Baskerville?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我是查尔斯·巴斯克维尔爵士的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yeah, I'm an executor of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遗嘱执行人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Charles Baskerville's will{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是在他的文件里发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and found it amongst his papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这件事关系到修果·巴斯克维尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It concerns Hugo Baskerville.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个庄园主 也是达特姆尔高原上的恶棍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He was Lord of the manor, Grimpen on Dartmoor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:06:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}达特姆尔高原？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dartmoor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.03,0:07:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两百多年前的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Some 200 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这份文件的年代在那之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The document is somewhat later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「得知此事后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}"Learn then from this story{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将来定要小心慎行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to be circumspect in the future, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以免我们家族过去所尝到的深重痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that those foul passions whereby{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于我们这些后代的败落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}our family has suffered may not be loosed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而重新降临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}again to our comparable ruin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1742年11月8日「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}8th of November 1742, " was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这序言真吸引人 是不是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Intriguing preamble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在报上看到过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've read of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯·巴斯克维尔爵士的死讯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Charles Baskerville's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从医学角度来说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}From a medical point of view{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真没报道出什么内容{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it was a poorly informed article.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他死于呼吸困难和心脏衰竭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He died of dyspnea and cardiac exhaustion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这两个症状是连锁出现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Were the conditions linked{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是同时出现的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}or were they parallel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}依我看来 症状是连锁出现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh they were linked in my opinion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的面部有些 有些扭曲变形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There was some, some facial distortion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.77,0:07:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以推测是心绞痛引起的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Caused by the cardiac pain presumably?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听你的口气好像有点怀疑啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You sound doubtful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.82,0:07:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那面孔可不是一般的扭曲变形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was not merely facial distortion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里写着 在1692年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well here in 1692{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.17,0:07:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修果·巴斯克维尔掳走了一个年轻姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hugo Baskerville abducted a young girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是她穿过沼泽逃了出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but she escaped across the moor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在一个诅咒之夜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}at night cursing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.12,0:08:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把犬舍里的狗都放出来去追她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He unkenneled his pack of hounds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像狩猎一只小动物一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and hunted her down like a wild animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当他那另三个醉醺醺的狐朋狗友赶到时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When his 3 drunken companions followed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只见那姑娘已深陷沼泽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}they found the girl in a deep dip or goyal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.45,0:08:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为过度疲惫和惊恐而死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}dead from fear and fatigue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她丧命的原因是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And it also confronted the cause of her death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一只巨大的恶魔般的猎犬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a huge, demonic hound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们目睹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Even as they looked{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猎犬撕扯着修果·巴斯克维尔的喉咙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the hound tore the throat out of Hugo Baskerville.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中一个当晚就被吓死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}One companion died that very night of what he saw, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.01,0:08:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}剩下的两个也被吓得精神失常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the other twain were broken men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终身都成了废人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for the rest of their days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个传说从那时起便一直萦绕着这个家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The sound is supposed to have haunted the family since then{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不祥的气氛始终笼罩着他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to the general misfortune of the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well this may appeal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倒是很对你那喜欢恐怖小说的胃口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to your lurid taste in fiction Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.62,0:09:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个神话故事 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's a fairy tale sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.93,0:09:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然是的 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Of course Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.97,0:09:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果其中没有一点事实的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but fairy tales would not survive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不会流传这么久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}without a kernel of truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯爵士死去的那天晚上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}On the night Sir Charles died{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在刚点灯的时间 就到了巴斯克维尔庄园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I arrived at Baskerville Hall at first light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要告诉你们我所看见的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I shall tell you what I found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝无添减{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No more or less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边走 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This way please sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我关注他的状况有一段时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I had been concerned about him for some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.93,0:09:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对猎犬的传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He had become obsessed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}深信不疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with the Legend of the Hound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在凉亭那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's by the summerhouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他坚信他听到过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He believed he had heard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从沼泽传来的猎犬的吠声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the hound itself upon the moors, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他甚至坚信他看到过它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he even believed he had seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时我认为这些可怕的幻想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}At the time I took such morbid fancies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是查尔斯爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to be part and parcel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生理处于病态的部分表现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of Sir Charles' pathological condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.08,0:10:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而现在呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.01,0:10:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝不会那么认为了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I no longer believe that to be the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我们所知没有人动过他 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We didn't like to move him sir. Once we knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 做得好 白瑞摩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, Yes quite Barrymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.95,0:10:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这真是一场悲惨的意外 白瑞摩太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A sad occasion Mrs. Barrymore{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您一定彻夜未眠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}an unhappy vigil for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是我们的希望 医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He was our hope doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这附近乡村所有人的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hope for the country here about's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就是我们的全部世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He brought the world to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我们大家的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He was our hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在查尔斯爵士向小径跑去之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Before Sir Charles ran up the alley{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就站在门前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he had eloquently stood at the gate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少站了十分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for at least ten minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.07,0:11:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他抽的雪茄掉了两次烟灰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The ash had dropped twice from his cigar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且那里还有3根用过的火柴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and there were also 3 spent matches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您很出色 摩梯末医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm impressed by Dr. Mortimer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有别的痕迹吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Was there anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.35,0:11:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫非有脚印？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Footprints?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}男人的还是女人的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A man or a woman's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.61,0:11:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是只特大型的猎犬的爪印{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}they were the footprints of a gigantic hound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}许多人都曾在沼泽见过那只怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Several people have seen a creature upon the moor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是只巨型的怪物 狰狞可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a huge creature, ghastly, and spectral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我盘问过两个声称见过它的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've crossed examined 2 of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是脚踏实地的老实庄稼人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hardheaded countrymen both{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.58,0:11:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}描述的情形也都和传说对得上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and their stories tally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望您能告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I want you to advise me what I should do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利·巴斯克维尔爵士应该怎么办呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with Sir Henry Baskerville.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利·巴斯克维尔爵士原先生活在美国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Henry Baskerville has spent his life in America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他乘坐S.S.直布罗陀号到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He has come over on the S. S. Gibraltar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有您亨利爵士乘坐客船 我们不胜荣幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Been a pleasure having you aboard Sir Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Henry, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.68,0:11:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这头衔我听着还不太习惯呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I still haven't gotten used to that title.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有别人有权继承查尔斯爵士的遗产吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Was there any other claim upon Sir Charles' estate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.31,0:11:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他最小的弟弟 罗杰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His youngest brother, Roger, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为黄热病死于中非{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}died in Central America of yellow fever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三十多年前的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}some 30 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.57,0:12:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利爵士是巴斯克维尔家族最后的子嗣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Henry is the last of the Baskerville's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.13,0:12:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时您为什么没有马上请我去调查？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why did you not consult me immediately?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有的问题 就连最精明老练的侦探{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's a realm in which the most accomplished{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是毫无办法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}detective is helpless sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些事物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There are certain things here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然全然不符合自然规律{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which are impossible to reconcile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.91,0:12:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可依旧存在着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to the settled order of nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.45,0:12:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果您认为这属于超自然的范畴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If you believe this to be supernatural{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找个神父岂不是更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you'll find more help from a priest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.19,0:12:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, No, No, No, No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎样才能帮您呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How can I assist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.85,0:12:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得给我个说法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And I'll have an answer damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.06,0:13:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他正为靴子的事发火呢 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's in a stir sir about his boot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}搞什么 如果找不到我的旧黑靴 就要他好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}By thunder if that fellow can't find my old black boot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您丢的是一只新的棕色靴子吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Surely it was a new brown boot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.71,0:13:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 昨天晚上他们把棕色的那双拿走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No last night they took one of the brown ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天他们又偷走了一只黑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Today they've sneaked one of the black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 摩梯末医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sorry Mortimer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉为这些琐事麻烦你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sorry to trouble you with this nonsense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可这还是所谓第一流的旅店啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but this is a first class hotel damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯为您效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我倒觉得这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I think it is worth troubling about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.36,0:13:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很值得讨论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as a matter of fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您何出此言？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You do why?{\r}
