Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你感冒了么 华生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Have you got a cold Watson?{\r}
