Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.58,0:14:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Clearly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去了德文郡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've been at Devonshire.{\r}
