Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.51,0:15:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用那么远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Disused is it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周围的一切都是多余{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and all the rest is waste{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们那高明的罪犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as far as the great convict, {\r}
