Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摩梯末医生 我想现在应该您来解释了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dr. Mortimer I think it is time that you explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在您了解情况了 亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well now you know the facts Sir Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.37,0:19:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The question is whether or not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您究竟该不该到达特姆尔去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you should go to Dartmoor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.99,0:19:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有任何地狱里的魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's no devil in hell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是世人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}nor no man on this earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能阻止我回到我的家乡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that's going to prevent me from going to the home of my own people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.67,0:19:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样的话 我们就看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Then we'll see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.61,0:19:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎样把危险减到最低吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}how we can mitigate the danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.99,0:19:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您当真相信会有危险？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You really believe there is danger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.70,0:19:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想如果真有危险 就一定会出大事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I think that if it is, that it is considerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您一定不能单独行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You certainly cannot go alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.65,0:19:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摩梯末医生和我一同回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dr. Mortimer returns with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的诊所和家离你那儿还有几英里远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He has his practice and he lives some miles distant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您能亲自去么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You'll come yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.91,0:19:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得待在伦敦 有一桩勒索的案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have to stay in London, blackmail case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我委托我的朋友华生前去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I recommend my friend Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.45,0:19:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您真是太好了 医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That's very kind of you Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 摩梯末医生… - 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- Dr. Mortimer… - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.19,0:20:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.31,0:21:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那人是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Who was that man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.18,0:21:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well how did you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人在跟踪巴斯克维尔先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}someone's been following Baskerville?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不是跟踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How else did they know so immediately{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.11,0:21:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们怎么能立刻知道他住在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}where he was staying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起码现在他们不会再跟踪他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}At least they'll not continue to follow him now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 当危险到来的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When the crisis comes Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定会到来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and it will, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要向我报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}report to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.59,0:21:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你知道查尔斯·巴斯克维尔爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson do you know what the residue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.13,0:21:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}留下来的遗产有多少么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of Sir Charles Baskerville's estate was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多一百万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Close to a million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这人演这出危险大戏的赌注{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A stake on which a man might play a dangerous game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.37,0:22:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是很大一笔财富{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Such a sum has a definite materiality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.68,0:22:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过现在 一切还都天差地远呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And yet of all things in heaven and earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都是讲科学的人 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We are men of science Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.37,0:22:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是桩邪恶又危险的案子 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's an ugly, dangerous business Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.01,0:22:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 如果你能平安回到贝克街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Believe me I should be very glad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.97,0:22:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会很高兴的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to have you back safe and sound in Baker Street Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.79,0:23:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.55,0:23:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的华生 我不会说任何建议和怀疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My dear Watson I will not bias your mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.17,0:23:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来干扰你的思维{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by suggesting theories or suspicions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.85,0:23:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要讲事实报告给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Simply report facts to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.53,0:23:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽可能写得详细{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the fullest possible manner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.24,0:23:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随后的日子里你得集中注意力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Concentrate your attention upon the following.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.63,0:24:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总之 一如古老的羊皮纸上写的那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Above all, avoid the moor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.52,0:24:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别在黑夜降临 罪恶势力嚣张之时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when as the old parchment frankly put it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.81,0:24:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走过沼泽地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the paths of evil are exalted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.55,0:26:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么回事 伯金斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What is this Perkins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.24,0:26:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个罪犯从普林斯顿监狱越狱了 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Convict, escaped from Princetown sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.47,0:26:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有三天了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's 3 days now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.02,0:26:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到处都在搜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They've been watching all over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.34,0:26:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还没发现他的任何踪迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}they ain't seen no sign of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.53,0:26:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}农户们都有些不安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Farmers don't like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.00,0:26:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逃出来的是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Who is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塞尔丹 在诺丁山杀人的凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Selden, the Notting Hill murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.34,0:26:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家家都门窗紧锁呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Folk are locking their doors I can tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.38,0:26:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这人干了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What'd the man do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.74,0:26:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他杀了一家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He murdered a whole family{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.33,0:26:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}手段极其残忍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with such savagery they deemed him insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.01,0:28:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎您 亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Welcome Sir Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.63,0:28:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎来到巴斯克维尔庄园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Welcome to Baskerville Hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.63,0:28:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是白瑞摩吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's Barrymore yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.67,0:28:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听候您的吩咐 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}At your service sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.22,0:28:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是白瑞摩太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Barrymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.11,0:28:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太太你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Madame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.92,0:28:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要有需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If I can be of service{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.09,0:28:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论白天黑夜都尽管来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}do not hesitate to send for me day or night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.38,0:28:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Of course, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.41,0:28:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Walk on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.35,0:28:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边请 亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This way Sir Henry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.03,0:29:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们家族的五百年历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Five hundred years of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.29,0:29:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如我想象中的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Just as I imagined it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.13,0:29:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全就和我想的一模一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}To much as I imagined it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.68,0:29:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这地方需要放上些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This place needs the products{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.13,0:29:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯旺或是爱迪生的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of Mr's Swann and Edison{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.48,0:29:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我想我会适应的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I suppose I can tone down to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.64,0:30:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.69,0:30:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白瑞摩先生 晚餐非常美味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Excellent meal Barrymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.93,0:30:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请代我们谢谢白瑞摩太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Please thank Mrs. Barrymore for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.74,0:30:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.69,0:30:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的喜欢一定会让她很高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}She'll be pleased you enjoyed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.74,0:30:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生 我们走吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well Dr. Watson shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.73,0:31:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.81,0:31:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白瑞摩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Barrymore, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.32,0:31:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.42,0:31:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.45,0:31:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妻子和我都很乐意留在您身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}my wife and I will be happy to stay with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.61,0:32:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到你安顿下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}or till you've settled in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.73,0:32:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做出你自己的安排{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and made your arrangements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.01,0:32:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你的家族世代与我们在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But your family's been with us for generations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.48,0:32:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我在这里开始的新生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sorry to start my life here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.16,0:32:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要打破这段悠久的往来 我会很遗憾的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}breaking an old family connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.47,0:32:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.25,0:32:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妻子和我都很敬爱查尔斯爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My wife and I were much attached to Sir Charles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.78,0:32:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他的故世{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.61,0:32:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们觉得没有什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We feel that nothing can be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.87,0:32:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们觉得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}we feel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.85,0:32:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续留在这里 会使我们很不好受 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}we feel we shall never be easy here at the hall sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.54,0:32:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.97,0:32:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们有何打算？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well what do you mean to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.22,0:32:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于查尔斯爵士的慷慨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh Sir Charles's generosity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.07,0:32:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给了我们一笔钱可以让我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}has given us the means to set up in business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.76,0:32:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做些小本买卖 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in a small way sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.80,0:33:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你告诉我这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well thank you for telling me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.65,0:33:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以期待一下 某天在你家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Might I look forward to you pulling me a pint{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.66,0:33:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得到你一杯美酒的招待吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in your own house one day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.56,0:33:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是当然了 先生 谢谢您 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That is the sort of thing sir thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.99,0:33:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.20,0:33:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这么约定了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mind you call it Baskerville arms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.21,0:33:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.60,0:33:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.95,0:33:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个男人害怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That man is frightened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.32,0:33:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.00,0:33:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上不好捱啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Turning into a rough night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.27,0:33:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上我要步行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I shall walk over to the post office{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.07,0:33:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去格林盆的邮局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}at Grimpen in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.03,0:34:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 可是福尔摩斯嘱咐过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sorry but Holmes asked me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.15,0:34:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能让您单独离开房子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}not to let you leave the house without…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.86,0:34:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生 这玩意儿可以对付任何一条狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor, this shall take care of any dog{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.29,0:34:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算没有你的相陪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that I may meet in your absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.83,0:34:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算你有武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Even armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.18,0:34:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.37,0:34:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天早上我会留在家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Tomorrow morning shall find me at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.73,0:34:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在家总安全了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm safe at home am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.57,0:34:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯是这么相信的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well that's what Holmes believes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.19,0:34:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是桩邪恶又危险的案子 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's an ugly and dangerous business Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.95,0:35:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 如果你能平安回到贝克街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I shall be glad to have you back safe and sound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.25,0:35:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会很高兴的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in Baker Street once more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.02,0:35:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有的问题就连最精明老练的侦探也束手无策{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's a realm in which the most accomplished detective is helpless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.65,0:35:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些事物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There are certain things here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.33,0:35:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然全然不符合自然规律{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which are impossible to reconcile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.98,0:35:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可依旧存在着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to the settled order of nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.23,0:35:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总之 一如古老的羊皮纸上写的那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Above all avoid the moor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.88,0:35:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别在黑夜降临 罪恶势力嚣张之时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}whereas the old parchment quaintly puts it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.23,0:35:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走进沼泽地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the powers of evil are exalted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.18,0:36:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道查尔斯·巴斯克维尔爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do you know what the residue of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.97,0:36:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}留下来的遗产有多少么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Charles Baskerville's estate was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.54,0:36:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多一百万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Close to a million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.14,0:36:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这人演这出危险大戏的赌注{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Such a sum has such a distinctive materiality about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.63,0:36:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.51,0:36:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天您好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How are you today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.76,0:36:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh very well thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.95,0:36:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.18,0:36:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谢谢 先生 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- Thank you sir. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.64,0:37:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.65,0:37:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Goodbye sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.58,0:37:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dr. Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.55,0:37:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请饶恕我的冒昧推测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Excuse my presumption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.02,0:37:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摩梯末医生在您经过他诊所窗前的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dr. Mortimer pointed you out to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.18,0:37:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把您指给了我看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}from the window of his surgery as you passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.20,0:37:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许他已经告诉你的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Possibly he's told you my name, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.75,0:37:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅利琵宅邸的斯泰普顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Stapleton of Merripit House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.54,0:37:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 当然 您好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes indeed, how do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.70,0:37:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都很担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We were concerned, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.67,0:37:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗兰克兰 摩梯末 和我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Frankland, Mortimer and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.89,0:37:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}担心？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Concerned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.41,0:37:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不太希望亨利爵士回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Less Sir Henry should not have come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.69,0:37:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道那个恶犬的传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You know the legend of the fiend hound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.52,0:37:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们本以为这会让他噩梦缠身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We thought it might seize his imagination{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.47,0:37:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像可怜的查尔斯伯爵受到的影响一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}just as it seized poor Sir Charles's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.63,0:37:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夏洛克 福尔摩斯先生还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How is Mr. Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.38,0:37:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生 您既然因此而来到此地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dr. Watson you are here of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.00,0:37:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么这一定引起了福尔摩斯先生的兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It follows then that Mr. Holmes is interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.21,0:37:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恐怕无法回答你的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm afraid I cannot answer your question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.22,0:38:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请容我一问 我们有这个荣幸见到他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well may I ask if he is going to honor us with a visit himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.38,0:38:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他离不开城里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He cannot leave town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.47,0:38:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有别的案子要忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Other cases engage his attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.79,0:38:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.65,0:38:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来这只是单纯拜访我的朋友 亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm simply here to visit my friend, Sir Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.02,0:38:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I do not need help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.57,0:38:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为我的打扰道歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I apologize for the intrusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.70,0:38:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沿着这条小径慢慢走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A moderate walk along this path{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.61,0:38:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以把我们带到梅利琵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}brings us to Merripit House{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.93,0:38:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许您愿意抽出一个小时 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I wonder or perhaps you would spare me an hour Dr. Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.33,0:38:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我有这个荣幸 把您介绍给我的妹妹认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that I may have the pleasure of introducing you to my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.04,0:38:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴斯克维尔庄园的人还在等我回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm expected back at Baskerville hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.86,0:38:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我想一个小时不会有大碍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sure an hour will not hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.03,0:38:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 斯泰普顿先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you Mr. Stapleton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.70,0:38:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是因为对昆虫学的研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was entomology was it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.06,0:38:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你走进这片沼泽吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that brought you to the moor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.77,0:38:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确 但是它本身也吸引了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Indeed although I delight in it for it's own sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.44,0:38:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里如此广阔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is so vast, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.31,0:38:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此荒凉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}so barren, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.52,0:38:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此神秘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}so mysterious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.06,0:38:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如看那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well there for instance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.08,0:38:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有何感受？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}what do you make of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.52,0:39:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是块少有的能纵马奔驰的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well it would be a rare place for a gallop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.29,0:39:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是伟大的格林盆泥沼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That is the great Grimpen Mire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.83,0:39:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论人畜 在那儿走错一步 就意味着死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}False step down means death to man or beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.37,0:39:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天我还看到一匹小马驹闯进那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well only yesterday I saw one of the moor ponies wonder into it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.02,0:39:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再也没有出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Never came out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.16,0:39:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过了很长时间我还看到它的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I could see his head for quite some time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.49,0:39:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从泥坑里探出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}straining out of the bog hole, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.46,0:39:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但最终还是被吞噬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but it sucked him down at last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.73,0:39:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算是在旱季里 要穿越它也是很危险的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Even the dry season it is a danger to cross it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.24,0:39:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而最近连续下了几场雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but after these recent rains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.26,0:39:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它就成了一块不幸之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it is an awful place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.20,0:39:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And yet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.79,0:39:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以找到一条直达它腹地的路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I can find my way to the very heart of it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.12,0:39:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再活着回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and return alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.31,0:39:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你为什么想要去那么恐怖的地方呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But why should you wish to visit such a horrible place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.91,0:39:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看到那里低矮的小山了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You see the low hills there beyond it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.49,0:39:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们是真正的岛屿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They're really islands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.58,0:39:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里的植物群与世隔绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Flora there is undisturbed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.00,0:39:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就意味着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which mean of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.75,0:39:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会有稀有的物种生长在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that rare species can breed there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.74,0:39:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中有一种兰凯尼迪的亚种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and one of them a subspecies Lycanidi{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.74,0:40:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这里特有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is unique to the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.81,0:40:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上是我发现的它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In fact I'm credited with its discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.65,0:40:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.39,0:40:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沼泽里到处是声响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The moor is full of noises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.91,0:40:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But what was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.35,0:40:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}农夫说它是巴斯克维尔的猎犬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The peasants say it is the Hound of the Baskervilles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.76,0:40:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正在捕食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}calling for its prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.54,0:40:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会相信这种无稽之谈吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You don't believe such nonsense surely?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.46,0:40:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有听过鸬鹚叫吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did you ever hear the boom of a bittern?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.39,0:40:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.85,0:40:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说这种鸟眼下只有在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The bird is said, now, to be confined to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.51,0:40:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诺福克的沼泽里出没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}certain Norfolk fens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.11,0:40:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但为什么这里就不能有呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but why not here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.46,0:40:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说它的叫声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've heard its cry described{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.70,0:40:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被描绘成介于{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as being something between{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.34,0:40:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尖锐的雾角和 灵魂的惨叫声之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a foghorn and a soul in torment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.47,0:40:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.35,0:40:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ah, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.21,0:40:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯罗派德飞蛾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Cyclopides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.48,0:41:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Go back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.94,0:41:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马上就回伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Go straight to London instantly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 照我说的做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}For God's sake do as I ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.40,0:41:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回去吧 再也不要踏入这里半步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Go back and never set foot on the moor again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.02,0:41:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘘 我哥哥回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sh, my brother is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.19,0:41:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯泰普顿小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Miss Stapleton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.31,0:41:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不惜一切代价离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Get away from this place at all costs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.19,0:41:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您看见那兰花了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do you see that orchid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.47,0:41:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 我看见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, yes I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.72,0:41:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真可惜您来晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's a pity you came so late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.27,0:41:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们最好的兰花都已经凋谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Our best orchids are nearly over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.52,0:41:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.23,0:41:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看见你已经自我介绍过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You have introduced yourselves I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.47,0:41:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.77,0:41:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正对亨利爵士说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was telling Sir Henry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.01,0:42:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他错过了我们沼泽最美的风景{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it's a pity he has missed the beauties of the moor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.39,0:42:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我是亨利爵士 斯泰普顿小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Were I Sir Henry Miss Stapleton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.29,0:42:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定不会错过您的美丽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sure I would not miss your beauty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.47,0:42:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惜我不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I'm afraid I'm not, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.04,0:42:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利爵士是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Henry that is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.34,0:42:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我算是他的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}merely his friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.56,0:42:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 华生医生愿意为您效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor John Watson at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.40,0:42:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你抓住你的蝴蝶了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did you catch your butterfly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.99,0:42:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.21,0:42:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}高山上的飞虫就像是巫女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Highly flies like a witch I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.49,0:42:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ah there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.58,0:42:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.64,0:42:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请您原谅并忘记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You must forgive and forget{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.59,0:42:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚才愚蠢的鲁莽 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}my foolish outburst Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.20,0:42:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我忘不了 斯泰普顿小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I cannot forget Miss Stapleton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.22,0:42:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您必须得忘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.87,0:42:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利爵士是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Henry is my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.22,0:42:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在乎他的安危{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His welfare is a very close concern of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.97,0:42:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我你为何如此急于{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Tell me why you are so eager{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.43,0:42:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他回伦敦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that he should return to London?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.29,0:42:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道猎犬的故事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You know the story of the hound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.80,0:42:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不相信这种无稽之谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I do not believe such nonsense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.93,0:42:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.60,0:42:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果亨利爵士肯听您的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If you have any influence with Sir Henry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.66,0:42:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带他走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}take him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.82,0:42:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕除非你告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I fear that unless you can give me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.41,0:42:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比这更可靠的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}more definite information than this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.87,0:42:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则是没法让他离开这儿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it would be impossible to get him to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.62,0:43:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说不出确切的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I cannot say anything definite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.48,0:43:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我不知道什么是确切的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for I do not know anything definite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.53,0:43:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯泰普顿小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Miss Stapleton, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.27,0:43:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想再问你一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I would ask you one more question, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.67,0:43:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果仅仅如此而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you meant no more than this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.29,0:43:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何刚才你向我开口的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when you first spoke to me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.24,0:43:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此焦急 而且不让你的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}why were you so eager that your brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.08,0:43:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听到你所说的话？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}should not overhear what you said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.67,0:43:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并没有什么是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There is nothing to which he, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.78,0:43:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是谁会反对的呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}or anybody else, could object.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.51,0:43:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我哥哥很希望庄园能有人居住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My brother is very anxious to have the hall inhabited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.00,0:43:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他觉得这是件好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He thinks it's for the good{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.32,0:43:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对住在沼泽上的穷人来说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of the poor folk upon the moor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.49,0:43:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一定会生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He would be very angry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.69,0:43:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果让他知道我说了这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if he knew I had said anything, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.33,0:43:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}劝亨利爵士离开的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which might induce Sir Henry to go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.98,0:43:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}运气好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Any luck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.10,0:43:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Afraid not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.56,0:43:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}飞虫就像是巫女 却如此美丽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Flies like a witch and so beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.32,0:43:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纹黄蝶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Pale, clouded yellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.08,0:43:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经抓住了不少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have a number of them I've caught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.64,0:43:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定得给你看看我的收藏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I must show you my collection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.17,0:44:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰这块土地让我不再从医{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The English led the Doctor out of my field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.54,0:44:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对那些昆虫已经做了特别的研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And I've made a particular study of those insects, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.07,0:44:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们栖息于石南和湿地的周边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which inhabit the margins of heath and marsh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.15,0:44:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是庞大的收藏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A magnificent collection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.87,0:44:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很有科学家的风范{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the work of a serious scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.35,0:44:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至是那些奇特品种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Even the exotica, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.79,0:44:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须提一下这一神奇的物种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I must mention a brilliant creature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.82,0:44:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被称为莫普迪斯兰匹达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}called Morpo peridis lapida{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.57,0:44:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被按照日期编制成目录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}was dated and cataloged with the carrier replies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.88,0:44:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}归入他个人的发现 英国兰凯尼迪蝶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to his personal field, the British Lycanidi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.76,0:44:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们正是这沼泽里独有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}One of which is unique to the moor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.94,0:44:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也要向你报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I must also report{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.53,0:44:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只新的棕色靴子出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that the new brown boot has turned up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.83,0:44:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白瑞摩找到了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Barrymore found it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.00,0:44:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在他解开亨利先生的行礼时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}amongst Sir Henry's luggage when he unpacked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.95,0:44:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯泰普顿小姐落落大方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Miss Stapleton is very handsome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.43,0:44:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}星期二我们会在这里吃晚饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and on Tuesday we are to dine here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.71,0:45:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时邀请巴斯克维尔庄园的左邻右舍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}at Baskerville Hall with all our neighbors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.95,0:45:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是 亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So Sir Henry, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.03,0:45:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在受到你禁足令后终于喜上眉梢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}who chaffs a little at the restrictions you have imposed upon him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.52,0:45:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会有机会自己来评价对方美丽与否了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}will have a chance to judge her beauty for himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.55,0:45:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也会和摩梯末医生的太太见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We're also to meet Dr. Mortimer's wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.58,0:45:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及格林盆年长的牧师 他们说为人极其害羞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the old vicar of Grimpen who is very shy they say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.47,0:45:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有弗兰克兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and Mr. Frankland, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.15,0:45:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算得上一名业余的天文学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}an amateur astronomer of some note{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.97,0:45:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在人心目中是个得理不饶人的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}who has a reputation of being litigious to a fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.13,0:45:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个大喜的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A red-letter day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.72,0:45:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法律就是法律 我得好好教教他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The law is law and I need to teach them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.37,0:45:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被大家高高抬起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have established a right-of-way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.60,0:45:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从老米德尔顿公园中央游行而过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}slapped through the middle of old Middleton's Park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.18,0:45:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天宣判的结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Case decided today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.72,0:45:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须教训教训那些混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We must teach these magnets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.63,0:45:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不能冷酷无情地肆意践踏百姓的权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}they cannot ride roughshod over the rights of commoners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.23,0:45:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天宣判的结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Case decided today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.65,0:45:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天 弗兰克兰先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Today Mr. Franklin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.24,0:45:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Today sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.93,0:45:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么问？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why do you ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.49,0:46:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说你在芬尼沃斯的森林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Seeing you in Fernworthy that you had the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.94,0:46:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要对村名关闭也是在今天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}wood bear closed to the villagers also today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.68,0:46:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我说了是个大喜的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Red-letter day as I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.79,0:46:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}True sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.48,0:46:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚我的肖像又要被人在芬尼沃斯焚烧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I shall be burnt in effigy tonight in Fernworthy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.79,0:46:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我有案子能告他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I have the case against them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.68,0:46:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坏人被认为没有财产权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Infernal people seem to think there are no rights of property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.64,0:46:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们随意而居{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They can swarm where they like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.83,0:46:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带着他们野餐的报纸和瓶子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with their picnic papers and bottles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.71,0:46:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们还有什么好抱怨的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but why should they complain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.12,0:46:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在没人去森林了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No one goes to the wood now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.83,0:46:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们必须穿过沼泽才能到那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They have to cross the moor to get to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.51,0:46:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人会去穿越沼泽的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No one will cross the moor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.43,0:46:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么呢 先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And why is that sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.01,0:46:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定听说过了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You've surely heard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.24,0:46:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猎犬在沼泽里出没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The hound walks abroad upon the moor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.72,0:46:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴斯克维尔的猎犬 亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The hound of the Baskervilles Sir Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.23,0:46:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.73,0:46:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有你一个人这么想吗 弗兰克兰先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is it a phenomenon you believe in yourself, Mr. Frankland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.82,0:46:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问问牧师吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ask the vicar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.21,0:46:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天文和法庭辩论是我的强项{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Astronomic and forensic matters are my domain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.95,0:46:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当地的事务是他的强项{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}demonic matters are his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.24,0:46:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真有猎犬吗 牧师 还是别的什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is it a hound of hell vicar or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.37,0:46:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.96,0:46:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个有趣的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}An interesting question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.96,0:47:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管被看见的究竟是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Whatever it is that is being seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.10,0:47:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它的确存在着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is undoubtedly something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.76,0:47:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的蹄铁匠 托马斯·查博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Our farrier, Thomas Chub, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.36,0:47:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不是一个无中生有的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is not a man given to visions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.51,0:47:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他在那里看到了某种东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and he saw something out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.68,0:47:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说是一条狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A dog he said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.39,0:47:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}个头有小牛那么大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}About the size of a calf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.19,0:47:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说当地人有些歇斯底里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And I do not think local hysteria{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.56,0:47:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我看来理由并不充分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is an adequate explanation myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.28,0:47:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管它到底是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I pray nightly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.88,0:47:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我每天晚上都祈祷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that it remove itself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.56,0:47:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它能离开我们这个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}from us whatever it is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.79,0:47:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们有更安稳的觉睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and that we all may sleep the more soundly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.42,0:47:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.05,0:47:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得让大伙儿坐卧不安的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I believe it is Selden, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.80,0:47:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该是那个杀人犯塞尔丹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the murderer who frightens the folk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.34,0:47:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格林盆一带的人都相信他仍在沼地里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In he Grimpen they believe is still upon the moor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.56,0:47:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们总是太富于优越感了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We are too ready to condescend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.64,0:47:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还总说这些可怜的人很迷信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and attribute superstition to these poor people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.19,0:48:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而事实上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when they are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.10,0:48:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们只是出于自然的本能的恐惧罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in fact subject to a natural and sensible fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.19,0:48:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妙极了 斯泰普顿小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Bravo, Miss Stapleton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.61,0:48:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妙极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Bravo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.57,0:48:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这条恶犬是无法逃脱法律惩罚的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This hellhound's existence would not survive a court of law, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.39,0:48:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纯粹是乡间传闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}mere hearsay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.45,0:48:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把它带到法庭上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Bring the thing before the bench{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.83,0:48:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经受法律的考验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the full blaze of jurisprudence say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.13,0:48:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才会相信它真的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I then I will believe in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.84,0:48:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.93,0:48:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你今晚的盛情款待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you for a nice evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.47,0:48:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 晚安 医生 - 很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- Good night, Doctor. - It's very nice to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.08,0:48:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利爵士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Henry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.37,0:49:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.71,0:49:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.92,0:49:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的朋友 今晚真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My dear fellow it's wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.52,0:49:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的红葡萄酒真是不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I must compliment you on that claret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.01,0:49:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}味道好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.95,0:49:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 真是太令人愉快了 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- Absolutely delightful. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.48,0:49:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Goodnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.33,0:51:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是白瑞摩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Barrymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.25,0:51:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他在那儿呆了半个小时了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes. He's been there a half an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.68,0:51:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What's he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.64,0:51:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.81,0:51:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.52,0:51:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在沼地上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Out on the moor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.67,0:51:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事发偶然 亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It just happened, Sir Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.38,0:51:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们肯定不能再到沼地里去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We must not go on to the moor in darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.84,0:52:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是不是有些夸大其词了 医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And then the powers are exalted, Doctor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.24,0:52:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妖怪是用来吓唬小孩的 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}bogie's to frighten children man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.47,0:52:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去吧 我们今晚有机会把事情查个水落石出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come on, we have a chance of getting to the bottom of this business tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.63,0:52:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.39,0:52:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.12,0:53:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.00,0:53:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想开枪 可是开不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I felt to shoot but I couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.21,0:53:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.43,0:53:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.10,0:53:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这些传言可信吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You believe there's any truth in these rumors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.94,0:53:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.65,0:53:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.07,0:53:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白瑞摩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Barrymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.66,0:53:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论如何不是塞尔丹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's not Selden at any rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.66,0:53:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在伦敦我们就被跟踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We were followed in London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.98,0:53:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在仍然受到跟踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and we're followed still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.80,0:53:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 回屋子里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come on, let's get back to the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.36,0:54:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底怎么回事 白瑞摩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What's this all about Barrymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.19,0:54:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 也许…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir, it may…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.33,0:54:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许看上去我们辜负了您的信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it may seem that we have betrayed your trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.11,0:54:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看上去？见鬼 白瑞摩 根本就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Seem? Damn it. Barrymore, you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.70,0:54:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生… 先生 这不是他的错 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir…sir, no fault of his, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.20,0:54:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不想那样干的 都是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He didn't want it, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.23,0:54:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我 是我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's me and mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.00,0:54:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个可怜人来向我求助 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The poor creature came to me for help sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.08,0:54:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么忍心拒绝呢？看到他受了他们那么多罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How could I refuse after what they have done to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.63,0:54:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白瑞摩太太 我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So then Mrs. Barrymore, I don't understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.72,0:54:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他干嘛要来找你这样可敬的女士呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}why should he come to respectable woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.22,0:54:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是她的弟弟 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's her brother, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.89,0:54:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.02,0:54:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是真的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's true, sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.69,0:54:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他到这儿来的时候饿得半死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He dragged himself here half starved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.86,0:55:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得我们还能怎么做呢？我们给了他食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And what would you expect? We fed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.61,0:55:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们把食物带出去给他 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We took food out for him sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.33,0:55:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像您会对待一条狗那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}no more than you would for a dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.66,0:55:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们希望他走掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We hoped he'd go, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.14,0:55:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是夜复一夜那灯光都在那里闪烁着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but the light has been there night after night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.62,0:55:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是真的吗 白瑞摩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is this true, Barrymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.54,0:55:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.79,0:55:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道那家伙干过什么吗 白瑞摩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Have you any conception what this man did Barrymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.96,0:55:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.17,0:55:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他已经是一个没有伤害力的人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But he's a broken man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.99,0:55:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们对他做了手术 驯服了他 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They've done surgery, sir, to tame him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.26,0:55:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就像是个孩子 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's like a child, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.94,0:55:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求您了 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Please, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.77,0:55:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白瑞摩太太 请你 请你起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Barrymore, please, please, get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.12,0:55:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样做有失尊严{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This is not dignified, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.19,0:55:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.95,0:55:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 他已经被安排好离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}By a leave, sir, arrangements have been made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.41,0:55:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几天后他就会离开这个国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He'll be out of the country in a few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.83,0:55:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恳求您 先生 别向警方举报他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I beg you sir, say nothing to the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.71,0:56:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得呢 医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What do you think, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.80,0:56:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说他现在不会再害人了 白瑞摩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You say he's harmless now Barrymore, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.21,0:56:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是他还拿大石头砸我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}yet he threw a rock at us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.30,0:56:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像小孩子扔石头那样啊 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}As a child might throw stones, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.14,0:56:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些谋杀常常萦绕在他心里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The murderous heart is gone out of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.18,0:56:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他现在就像是个受了惊的孩子 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's a frightening baby now, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.48,0:56:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个形容很恰当{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This is an apt description.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.73,0:56:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不会再害人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He will be harmless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.41,0:56:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 请把你的妻子带回房吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Very well. Please take your wife to your room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.87,0:56:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对这件事我们不会提起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We'll say nothing about this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.96,0:56:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.53,0:57:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还以为我们得到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I thought we had a chance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.73,0:57:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个彻底查清此事的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of getting to the bottom of this business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.74,0:57:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是我们所做的 似乎只是犯下了重罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}All we've seemed to of done is compound a felony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.25,0:57:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我还是很高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm glad though{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.43,0:57:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在沼地里听到了那个声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that you heard that sound on the moor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.80,0:57:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我原来已经开始觉得是我的幻听了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was beginning to think I'd dreamt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.72,0:57:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾经去过保护区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was in the territories once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.98,0:57:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那儿见到过不少狼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've heard wolves up there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.48,0:57:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是没有什么能像今晚的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but nothing to freeze the blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.00,0:57:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样让我毛骨悚然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}like that sound tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.65,0:57:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确信就是那条恶犬吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Are you convinced it's the hound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.90,0:57:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.11,0:57:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真希望福尔摩斯在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I wish to God Holmes was here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.65,0:57:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他怎么还不来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why does he not come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.33,0:58:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And yet, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.79,0:58:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当天亮了 小鸟又开始歌唱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when daylight and birdsong return, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.79,0:58:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夜晚那种阴暗的景象荡然无存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the black imaginings of the night evaporate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.34,0:58:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是摩梯末医生不断地拜访{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Even, Dr. Mortimer assiduous visits, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.88,0:58:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及期间他不变的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}accompanied as they are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.43,0:58:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有关骨头和尸体的谈话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by constant talk of bones, or mortal residue, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.43,0:58:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也无法抹杀沼地秋日的美景{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}fail to sour the beauties of the moor in autumn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.15,0:58:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是 我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We are, however, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.05,0:58:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于这个谜团依然毫无头绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}still far from the heart of the mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.40,0:58:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而最让我烦恼的问题就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The question, which most persistently at nags me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.28,0:58:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}石山上的那个人究竟是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is who's the man on the tor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.54,0:58:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得要是我们知道了他的身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}With his identity known{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.46,0:58:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就能找到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I feel we should have the key{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.79,0:58:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解开这个谜团的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to this fatal riddle within our grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.29,0:58:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这块布料很好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This is rather a nice piece of cloth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.30,0:58:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I think they…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.92,0:58:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此同时 我还发现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Meanwhile, I have discovered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.30,0:58:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的男主人心地非常善良{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a streak amiable fender hearfedness in my host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.76,0:59:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对差点射杀男仆的那个杀人犯小舅子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So guilty did, he feel of nearly shooting his servant's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.40,0:59:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}深感内疚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}murderous brother-in-law{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.77,0:59:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是他就给了白瑞摩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that he's given Barrymore{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.02,0:59:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不少他从美国带来的做工一流的衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}many of his excellent American clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.48,0:59:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他决心当好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Determined, as he now is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.73,0:59:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个英国乡绅的角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to play the role of English squire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.48,0:59:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管是从服装还是从其他方面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in dress as in anything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.15,0:59:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太美国化了 而我正打算翻开生活崭新的一页{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Much too American and I'm turning over a new leaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.82,0:59:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你拿去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.82,0:59:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您的好意 爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you kindly, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.97,0:59:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这衣服真不错啊 亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Very smart, Sir Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.35,0:59:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.72,0:59:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打算散步去梅利琵庄园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well, I'm going to stroll up to Merripit House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.31,0:59:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我该邀请斯泰普顿和他妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I thought I'd invite Stapleton and his sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.94,0:59:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我更愿意说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Rather I should say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.86,0:59:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是斯泰普顿小姐和她哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Miss Stapleton and her brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.29,0:59:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}星期一到我们这来用午餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to luncheon on Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.78,0:59:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我知道你不想要我跟你一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well, I know you won't want me to come with you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.16,1:00:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可福尔摩斯坚持要我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But, Holmes insisted that I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.20,1:00:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是 我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now, look here my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.33,1:00:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯不可能预见到某些事的发展{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holmes could not have foreseen certain developments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.04,1:00:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会成为一个很文明的电灯泡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You'd make a very civil gooseberry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.25,1:00:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我还是自己去就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No. I'm afraid I have to go alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.31,1:00:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一站 伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}London next stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.07,1:00:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一站 伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}London next stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.41,1:02:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴斯克维尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Baskerville!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.16,1:02:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴斯克维尔 你怎么敢这样 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Baskerville how dare you sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.00,1:02:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样来占我妹妹的便宜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}make advances at my sister in such a fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.19,1:02:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.87,1:02:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定我妹妹并没有做什么事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sure the lady gave you no reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.31,1:02:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你误会了她的好意吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to presume upon her good intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.06,1:02:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们欢迎您加入我们的圈子 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We welcome you into our circle sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.38,1:02:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你却用这种让人厌恶的关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and you repay the hospitality{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.53,1:02:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来回报我们的热情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by forcing your disgusting attentions upon her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.00,1:02:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是的 我向你保证 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No but I assure you sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.00,1:02:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的动机是纯洁高尚的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}my intentions are honorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.09,1:02:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚吧 先生… 滚回你老家去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Away sir…away to the hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.72,1:02:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Go on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.60,1:03:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hello Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.74,1:03:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是从哪儿冒出来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Where have you dropped from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.08,1:03:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟踪了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I took it upon myself to follow you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.95,1:03:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对福尔摩斯的承诺 比得体的行为更重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm afraid my duty to Holmes overrode my tact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.90,1:03:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.29,1:03:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望在格林盆没有人卖票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well hope they're not selling tickets in Grimpen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.55,1:03:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你都看到了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I assume you saw what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.18,1:03:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉不觉得这个当哥哥的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did he ever strike you as a bit crazy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.24,1:03:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些神经质？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}this brother of hers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.93,1:03:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不太觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not particularly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.33,1:03:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白他怎么会对我这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't know why he does me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.79,1:03:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么让他这么激动？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What's he getting so heated about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.06,1:03:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当他的妹夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What objection can he have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.43,1:03:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有什么好反对的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to me as a brother-in-law?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.70,1:03:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说他肯定不是反对我的身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I mean he can't object to my worldly position{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.58,1:03:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 他反对的就是我这个人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}so it's got to be me myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.62,1:03:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.72,1:03:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.48,1:03:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.88,1:04:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nor me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.40,1:04:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.80,1:04:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一刻也不许我们在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He won't let us be together not for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.77,1:04:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他应该意识到才对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He must realize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.27,1:04:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她眼里有一种光芒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You know what I don't understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.89,1:04:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胜过千言万语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}there's a light in her eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.71,1:04:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我了解这种感觉 打心底里明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that speaks louder than words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.14,1:04:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我不明白的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I know it…I know it in my heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.15,1:04:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把我当成了一个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but he treats me as if I was a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.00,1:04:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个闹剧里疯狂的色情骗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if I was a mad seducer in an old melodrama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.28,1:04:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是够荒谬的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh it's absurd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.39,1:04:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.28,1:04:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.03,1:04:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是在想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was just thinking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.26,1:04:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有关这条猎犬事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that this business with the hound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.87,1:04:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有对这个家族的诅咒等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the family curse and so on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.93,1:04:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是斯泰普顿有些信以为真的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If Stapleton partly believes it's true, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.59,1:04:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他会因此不想让他妹妹嫁给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}perhaps he might want his sister not to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.00,1:04:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 我明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.07,1:05:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等到这个事情解决了再说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Just till the business is resolved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.02,1:05:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.97,1:05:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一起走回去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well shall we walk home together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.50,1:05:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赖恩天文台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The Ryan Observatory please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.73,1:05:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会永远为此对你感到抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I am forever in your debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.90,1:05:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 根本不必如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh no not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.65,1:05:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.75,1:05:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日安 亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good day Sir Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.23,1:06:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好极了哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.02,1:06:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.22,1:06:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯泰普顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Stapleton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.11,1:06:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还是觉得这家伙神经兮兮的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I still think the fellow's crazy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.98,1:06:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是他刚刚向我表达了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but he's just given me the most complete apology{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.80,1:06:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这一辈子能听到的最由衷的歉意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a man's ever likely received in his life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.62,1:06:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且他还邀请我们明天去他那用餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and he's invited us to dinner tomorrow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.29,1:06:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是星期五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Friday indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.58,1:06:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好啊 我很想去呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good I'll look forward to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.64,1:06:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格林盆的邮局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The post at Grimpen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.00,1:06:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Just so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.76,1:07:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.67,1:08:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能跟您说句话吗 先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}May I have a word sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.10,1:08:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.27,1:08:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您… 您对我们一直很好 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You…you've been very good to us sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.28,1:08:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿意为您效犬马之劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I should like to do the best I can for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.54,1:08:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现了一件事情 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's something I found out sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.52,1:08:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.78,1:08:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是在聆讯后发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We found it after the inquest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.55,1:08:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们谁也没告诉 不知该怎么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}hadn't told a mortal soul didn't know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.03,1:08:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是有关查尔斯爵士之死 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's about Sir Charles' death sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.44,1:08:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道他是怎么死的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You know how he died?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.22,1:08:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.48,1:08:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well what then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.15,1:08:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道那时他为什么会出现在大门口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I do know why he was at the gate at that hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.23,1:08:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.18,1:08:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去跟一个女人会面 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}To meet a woman sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.12,1:08:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.32,1:08:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能确定吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.52,1:08:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.30,1:08:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她叫什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well what was her name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.21,1:09:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只能告诉您她名字的缩写{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I can only give you her initials sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.04,1:09:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我太太发现了一样东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes there was something my wife found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.95,1:09:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她当时正在清洁这个房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}She was cleaning out this very room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.17,1:09:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是查尔斯爵士的书房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Charles's study sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.18,1:09:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在那边的壁炉里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the grate there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.06,1:09:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她发现了一块小纸片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}she found this scrap of paper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.86,1:09:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都烧掉了 爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it was all burnt but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.02,1:09:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过字迹还可以辨认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}well it could still be read.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.33,1:09:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从反光和笔迹看得出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}From the shine and the writing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.93,1:09:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您知道我的意思吧 先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you know what I mean sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.39,1:09:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我知道 接着说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Of course I understand please go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.85,1:09:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她把我叫来 我就把内容写了下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well she called to me and I wrote it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.10,1:09:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}“请您”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}"Please, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.02,1:09:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}“您是一位绅士”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}please as you are a gentleman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.75,1:09:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}“请您把这封信烧了”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}burn this letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.28,1:09:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}“十点钟在大门见”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and be at the gate by ten o'clock."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.61,1:09:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}“落款缩写是“L.L.”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Then the initials "L.L."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.39,1:11:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下午好 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good afternoon Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.48,1:11:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗兰克兰先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Frankland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.92,1:11:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上来吧 我替你上杯茶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come along up I shall order you tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.17,1:11:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.50,1:11:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You're here to solve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.69,1:11:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是来解开巴斯克维尔之谜的 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the Baskerville mystery are you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.75,1:11:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有个望远镜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well I have a telescope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.32,1:11:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以看到沼地上的景象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I see things on the moor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.03,1:11:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然是应该有所了解的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}surely you should know about them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.77,1:11:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这肖像太动人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This striking portrait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.89,1:11:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.28,1:11:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗拉 是你女儿吧 弗兰克兰先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lora, your daughter Mr. Frankland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.60,1:11:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.27,1:11:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes that is my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.87,1:11:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可现在不是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The woman she has become is not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.46,1:11:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边走 医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This way doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.92,1:11:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么回事呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.68,1:11:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我剥夺了她的继承权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Disinherited her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.62,1:11:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 真是令人难过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh I'm sorry to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.56,1:11:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哼 你知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You are what do you suppose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.71,1:11:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她对她爸爸都做了些什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}such a thing does to her father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.65,1:11:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.74,1:12:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嫁给了一个骗子 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Married her seducer sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.51,1:12:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个艺术家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}An artist, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.62,1:12:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所谓的艺术家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}so called, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.20,1:12:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是那种艺术家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}not that artist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.90,1:12:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那种艺术家能挣钱养活自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that artist earned his living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.19,1:12:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的那个艺术家太伟大了 以致无法出去挣钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Her artist was to grand to earn his living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.57,1:12:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艺术家？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Artist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.27,1:12:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}韦斯特尔 莱茵斯 一个叫莱茵斯的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Wastrel Lyons, fellow called Lyons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.57,1:12:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说过他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ever heard of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.94,1:12:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.48,1:12:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗拉 莱茵斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lora Lyons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.36,1:12:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人听说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nobody has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.48,1:12:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他追的是她的钱 其实是我的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}After her money, my money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.13,1:12:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上周在芬尼沃斯他们焚烧了我的肖像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was burned in effigy in Fernworthy last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.47,1:12:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得你曾经预言过会发生这样的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You predicted that I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.01,1:12:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点没错 因为我知道这里执法机关办事拖拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Exactly so because I know the slackness of authority here abouts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.91,1:12:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对政府的诉讼案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A case of Frankland v. Regina{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.62,1:12:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将会引起公众的关注{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}will bring the matter of all the attention to the public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.39,1:12:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过警方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I told the police they would have occasion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.10,1:12:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们那样对待我迟早会后悔的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to regret their treatment of me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.40,1:12:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我的话现在已经应验了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and already my words have come true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.35,1:12:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.40,1:12:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以告诉他们一件 他们迫切想知道的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I could tell them what they are dying to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.13,1:12:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可你并不打算这样做吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But you're not going to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.09,1:12:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Certainly not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.35,1:12:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是偷猎之类的事情吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Some case of poaching?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.96,1:12:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偷猎 哼 胡说八道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Poaching fiddlesticks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.77,1:12:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是那个逃犯塞尔丹 先生 那个疯狂的刺客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The convict sir, Selden, the mad stabber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.94,1:12:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该不会是说你知道他在哪儿吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You don't mean to say you know where he is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.75,1:12:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Near enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.97,1:12:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警方从来就没想到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It has never occurred to the police{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.65,1:13:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抓住这个人的最好方法就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that the way to catch the man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.19,1:13:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找出他食物的来源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}was to find out where he got his food{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.13,1:13:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再顺藤摸瓜去抓他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and so trace it to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.77,1:13:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白瑞摩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Barrymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.07,1:13:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的食物是由一个小孩送去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His food is taken to him by a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.06,1:13:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小孩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.32,1:13:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.69,1:13:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我观察了这孩子一个多星期了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have observed the child for more than a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.06,1:13:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小孩的本性天真{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is in the nature of children{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.46,1:13:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很容易对错误的对象忠心耿耿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to form perverse allegiances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.68,1:13:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是事情当然更有可能是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But surely it's more likely to be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.93,1:13:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沼地牧人的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the child of a moorland shepherd{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.36,1:13:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给他父亲送饭罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}taking him his lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.66,1:13:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是放牧的话 地点是常有变化的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Flocks move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.47,1:13:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Quick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.91,1:13:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor Watson quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.87,1:13:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我看到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes I see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.56,1:14:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摩梯末医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dr. Mortimer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.51,1:14:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.15,1:14:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要给你看一件不可思议的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have something marvelous to show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.49,1:14:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美极了 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Isn't it beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.25,1:14:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.41,1:14:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迄今为止我所找到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The most complete of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.17,1:14:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种头型中最为完整的一个了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it's kind I've yet found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.43,1:14:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又是我自己找到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I find it myself once more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.83,1:14:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天工人们都不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The laborers aren't here today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.81,1:14:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是非常漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is quite, quite beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.81,1:14:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这世上还有一种我不能容忍的动物的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If there's one animal on this planet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.22,1:14:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那应该就是兔子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which I cannot abide, it is a rabbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.69,1:14:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为啥？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.93,1:14:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兔子老是挖地洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Rabbit's burrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.29,1:14:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有没有想过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Have you any conception{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.07,1:14:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一窝兔子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of what a family of rabbits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.16,1:14:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一夜之间就能对挖掘工作造成的破坏吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}can do to the chronology of a dig in a single night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.15,1:14:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是要到墓地去 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You were on your way to Necropolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.31,1:15:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你愿意的话 我可以带你去参观{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I could show you around if you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.19,1:15:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}墓地？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The Necropolis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.55,1:15:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多人认为那是一个新石器时代的村落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Most people think it an in Neolithic village{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.73,1:15:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我有理由认为那是一个墓地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I have reason to believe that a burial ground{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.23,1:15:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有着一些非常有趣的特征{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}some most interesting features.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.28,1:15:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴有你陪伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I shall be glad of your company{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.81,1:15:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那边有人在露营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}there someone bivouacked near there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.10,1:15:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.40,1:15:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是那个亨利爵士一到这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's the man who has been at Sir Henry's heels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.14,1:15:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就开始跟踪他的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}since he landed here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.68,1:15:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他心怀不轨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I can't think his motives are benevolent so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.79,1:15:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以要是你能来 再带上你擅长使用的那把枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you come I shall be obliged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.25,1:15:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将感激不尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you bring that gun you handle so well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.81,1:15:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许会有危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There may be some danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.45,1:15:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果有危险的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If there's to be danger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.95,1:15:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两把枪总比一把强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}then 2 guns will be better than one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.57,1:15:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.30,1:15:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认识罗拉 莱茵斯吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.98,1:15:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}认识 她是老弗兰克兰的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Old Frankland's daughter, yes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.26,1:15:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是我的病人之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}she's a patient of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.67,1:15:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她住在库柏特斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}She lives in Coombe-Tracey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.31,1:15:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道他剥夺了她的继承权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's cut her off you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.88,1:15:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个子儿也不给她吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}without a penny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.39,1:15:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道她认识查尔斯爵士吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do you know she was acquainted with Sir Charles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.13,1:15:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 那倒是有可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh it's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.87,1:15:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的婚姻出现问题之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}After her marriage went wrong{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.30,1:15:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她开始出去工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}she was able to set up for herself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.74,1:15:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当打字员挣点薪水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in a small way as a typist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.89,1:15:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许工作是查尔斯爵士帮她找的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Charles may have made that possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.91,1:16:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他为不少慈善事业捐资{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He was a man who fostered many good causes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.17,1:16:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也许就是受资助者之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}She may have been one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.25,1:16:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱茵斯是怎样的一位画家？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What sort of a painter was Lyons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.58,1:16:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 才华出众{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.48,1:17:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}“华生医生在赖福特庄园”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}"Dr. Watson is at Lafter Hall."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.52,1:17:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许那位神秘人所跟踪的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Perhaps it is you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.33,1:17:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}who's been dogged by this secret man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.46,1:17:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而并非亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not Sir Henry at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.29,1:17:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们该怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.20,1:17:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打算等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I intend to wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.62,1:18:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}灯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.87,1:18:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是个美好的夜晚 医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's a lovely evening Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.02,1:18:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得你到外面来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I really think you would be more comfortable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.29,1:18:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会比呆在里头更舒服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}outside than in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.74,1:18:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我看见一个雪茄烟头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When I see a cigarette stub{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.56,1:18:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牌子是布莱德雷 牛津街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}marked Bradley Oxford Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.09,1:18:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我的朋友华生就在附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I know my friend Watson is in the neighborhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.99,1:19:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那枪要小心点哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Be careful with that gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.83,1:19:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还以为你在贝克街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I thought you were in Baker Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.60,1:19:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忙着那起勒索案呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}working on that case of blackmail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.83,1:19:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就是想让你这样认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That's what I wished you to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.78,1:19:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该对我有更好的印象 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've deserved better at your hands Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.56,1:19:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你利用我又不信任我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You used me and do not trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.26,1:19:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 要是我出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well my presence would have warned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.63,1:19:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的厉害对手就会警惕起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}our very formidable opponents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.41,1:19:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提防着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and put them in our guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.26,1:19:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有必要让你和亨利爵士认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was essential that you and Sir Henry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.45,1:19:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直在伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}believed me to be in London all the time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.16,1:19:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样你们的行为才不会露馅儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and behaved accordingly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.99,1:19:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摩梯末医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor Mortimer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.55,1:19:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.51,1:19:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在德文郡呆了多久了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How long have you been in Devon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.81,1:19:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来的第二天晚上你就看见我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Right after you saw me on my second night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.74,1:19:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时我真是很蠢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when I was foolish enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.14,1:19:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然站在月光下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to show myself against the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.67,1:19:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我的报告全都白费了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}All of my reports have been wasted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.58,1:19:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非都是白费的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not all of them you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.39,1:19:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都在这儿呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Here they are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.85,1:19:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你保证我都认真拜读了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and very well thumbed I assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.16,1:19:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还不得不贿赂这里的邮局呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I had to subvert the local post office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.30,1:19:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干得好 亲爱的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Brilliant my dear fellow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.03,1:20:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.58,1:20:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你们肯定有好多事要商谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You must, I know, have much to discuss{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.16,1:20:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我也得回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I must be getting home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.07,1:20:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还有个问题 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Please one question Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.39,1:20:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是不是快发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Are you any closer to discovering what, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.48,1:20:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那条所谓的猎犬到底是什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if anything, the hound is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.92,1:20:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.93,1:20:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它真的存在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Does it exist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.68,1:20:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.93,1:20:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 摩梯末医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you Dr. Mortimer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.21,1:20:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.16,1:20:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日安 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good day Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.49,1:20:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you for your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.43,1:20:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我看看我能给你点什么吃的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now let me see what meager refreshment I can provide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.62,1:20:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡怀特 听差所的那个小男孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Cartwright, the little chap from the express office, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.63,1:20:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把他带到这儿来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I brought him down with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.50,1:20:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以满足我简单的日常需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to look after my simple wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.93,1:20:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一条面包和一条干净的衬领就足够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A loaf of bread and a clean collar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.11,1:20:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现有个住在库柏特斯的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've discovered that there's a woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.58,1:20:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}名字的缩写就是L.L.{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Iiving in Coombe-Tracey with the initials L.L.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.66,1:21:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 是的 弗兰克兰的女儿罗拉 莱茵斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe yes Frankland's daughter, Lora Lyons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.97,1:21:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们调查方向一致啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Our research has been running along the same lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.79,1:21:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did you know that she's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.61,1:21:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她正打算跟她的丈夫离婚吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}seeking a divorce from her husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.14,1:21:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她却没有钱来打离婚官司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But she lacks the means to carry it through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.95,1:21:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那笔费用可不菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is a costly business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.18,1:21:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尝尝我的炖菜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do try my stew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.59,1:21:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 摩梯末医生认为查尔斯爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe, now Dr. Mortimer thought that Sir Charles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.70,1:21:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该是她背后的捐助人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}might have been a discreet benefactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.29,1:21:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.41,1:21:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That's interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.47,1:21:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃吧 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Please Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.31,1:21:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很恶心哎 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Its quite disgusting Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.27,1:21:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.71,1:21:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.09,1:21:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 趁热吃更好吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well it's better when it's hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.76,1:21:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗？罗拉 莱茵斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did you know there was a close intimacy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.05,1:21:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和那个昆虫学家斯泰普顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}between Lora Lyons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.59,1:21:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两人关系亲密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the entomologist, Stapleton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.71,1:21:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No I did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.16,1:21:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他们私会还相互通信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes they meet, they write.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.22,1:21:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她无疑正指望成为他的太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}She's no doubt counting on becoming his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.16,1:21:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我们手中最有力的武器了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That is the most powerful weapon in our hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.83,1:21:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.75,1:21:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.25,1:21:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为事实上斯泰普顿小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Because Miss Stapleton is in reality{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.76,1:22:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是斯泰普顿的妻子 而不是他妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Stapleton's wife not his sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.22,1:22:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的妻子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.48,1:22:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}往诺森布兰德旅馆 给我们发来警告的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes it was she who sent us that warning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.88,1:22:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to the Northumberland Hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.45,1:22:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么要如此精心地欺骗我们呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why this elaborate deception?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.46,1:22:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别问我细节 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Don't ask me the particulars Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.83,1:22:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过这是一起谋杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but it is murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.43,1:22:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起精心策划的冷酷的故意谋杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Refined, cold-blooded, deliberate murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.22,1:22:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是怎么得出这个结论的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What led you to it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.02,1:22:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是一位真正的昆虫学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He is a genuine entomologist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.49,1:22:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是他唯一的一次声明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But that mention of his sole, claim to fame, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.07,1:22:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是他发现了兰凯尼迪蝶亚种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}his discovery of a subspecies Lycanidi{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.51,1:22:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那对于他来说恰好是致命的证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that was his fatal moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.39,1:22:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为一个物种只能有一个发现者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There can only be one discoverer of a species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.42,1:22:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就暴露了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That pinpointed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.78,1:22:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是一次很辛苦的追踪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It has been a hard trail…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.51,1:22:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.49,1:23:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是亨利爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's Sir Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.27,1:23:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是塞尔丹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's Selden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.09,1:23:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是亨利爵士的衣服把这可怜的恶棍送上了西天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Henry's clothes were the poor devils death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.81,1:23:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是个可怜的恶棍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Poor devil indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.61,1:23:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上都不成人样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's only a half-life in truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.48,1:23:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}暂时不能让任何人知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No one must know for the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.07,1:23:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须把尸体藏起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We must hide the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.61,1:24:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能让亨利爵士知道这条猎犬的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Henry must know nothing of hearing the hound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.44,1:24:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样他才会有更好的勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He'll have a better nerve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.30,1:24:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去经受明天的考验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for the ordeal he must undergo tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.25,1:24:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是巴斯克维尔庄园了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So this is Baskerville Hall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.34,1:24:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请稍等一会儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}One moment please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.45,1:25:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看这是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.57,1:25:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是斯泰普顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's Stapleton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.60,1:25:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也是巴斯克维尔家的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's a Baskerville.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.32,1:25:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯爵士的弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Charles' brother, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.06,1:25:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在哥斯达黎加死于黄热病的那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}who died of yellow fever in Costa Rica, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.80,1:25:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他并非没有后裔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}did not die childless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.68,1:25:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们逮到他了 华生 我们逮到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We have him Watson, we have him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.79,1:25:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓 到明天晚上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And I do swear that by tomorrow night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.02,1:25:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就会落入我们的网中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he will be fluttering in our net{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.65,1:25:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像他的蝴蝶那样无助地挣扎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as helpless as well as his own butterflies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.36,1:26:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生和我得去伦敦一趟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I feel that Watson and I must go to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.04,1:26:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}London?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.68,1:26:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得在这儿节骨眼上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I think we will be more useful there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.42,1:26:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在那儿会更有用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}at this present juncture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.50,1:26:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.75,1:26:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以给我来杯新鲜的咖啡吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Might I have some fresh coffee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.96,1:26:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然了 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Certainly sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.40,1:26:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我还以为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But I thought you were going{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.16,1:26:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是打算来帮我渡过难关的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to see me through this business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.48,1:26:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 亲爱的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Trust me my dear fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.80,1:26:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.22,1:26:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉斯泰普顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Tell Stapleton that I would have been happy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.14,1:26:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本来很乐意陪你一同前往的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to come with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.83,1:26:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是有急事需要我去城里一趟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but the urgent business requires me to be in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.68,1:26:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.51,1:26:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道我不能跟你们一起去伦敦吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}should I not come with you to London?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.06,1:26:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么要我单独留下？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why should I stay here alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.49,1:26:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行 你必须留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No you must stay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.54,1:26:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且一定要按我说的去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and do exactly as I tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.59,1:26:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当然会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Of course I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.95,1:26:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开车去梅利琵庄园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Drive to Merripit House, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.18,1:27:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再把车打发回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}send the truck back and let it be known{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.87,1:27:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让大家以为你要步行回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that you intend to walk home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.48,1:27:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}穿过沼地吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Across the moor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.47,1:27:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在晚上？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}At night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.11,1:27:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我对你的胆识和勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If I had not every confidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.06,1:27:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有足够的信心的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in your nerve and courage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.94,1:27:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是不会建议你那样做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I would not suggest it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.30,1:27:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须得这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is essential that you do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.05,1:27:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会按你说的做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Then I will do just what you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.85,1:27:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走小路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Take the path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.39,1:27:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定要走从梅利琵到格林盆大路的那条小路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Exactly on the path from Merripit House{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.29,1:27:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是你回家通常会走的那条路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to the Grimpen Road, it is your natural way home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.10,1:27:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们打算什么时候走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And when do you intend to leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.47,1:27:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早餐后就动身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Immediately after breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.57,1:27:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 白瑞摩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you Barrymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.73,1:27:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用谢 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.22,1:29:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是莱茵斯太太吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Lyons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.65,1:29:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.79,1:29:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你承认是你要求查尔斯爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So you admit that you asked Sir Charles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.67,1:29:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十点钟在门口见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to meet you at the gate at ten o'clock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.99,1:29:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你却说你没有赴约？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but you say that you did not keep the appointment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.21,1:29:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.44,1:29:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道那是他死亡的确切时间吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You do realize that was the very hour of his death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.89,1:29:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是在指控我吗 先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is that an accusation sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.35,1:29:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.50,1:29:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只不过是在问你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm merely asking if you can forge a connection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.88,1:29:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否能推断出这两者间有什么联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}between the two events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.73,1:29:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有什么联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There is no connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.36,1:29:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱茵斯太太 我们认为这是一起谋杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Lyons we believe this to be a case of murder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.49,1:29:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而证据正指向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the evidence may implicate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.09,1:29:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的朋友斯泰普顿先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}not only your friend Mr. Stapleton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.59,1:29:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有他的太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but his wife as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.47,1:29:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他太太？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.61,1:29:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱茵斯太太 他所谓的妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Lyons the person who has passed for his sister{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.93,1:29:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实是他的妻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is really his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.11,1:30:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他妻子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.21,1:31:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.68,1:31:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯泰普顿承诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Stapleton offered me marriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.22,1:31:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我能跟我丈夫离婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on condition that I could obtain a divorce{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.17,1:31:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就会娶我为妻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}from my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.21,1:31:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他告诉我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He told me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.37,1:31:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他怎么能骗我呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}how he has lied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.66,1:31:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一而再再而三地欺骗我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He has lied and lied and lied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.56,1:31:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我干嘛还要真心对他呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why should I preserve faith with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.64,1:31:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他根本就没有真心对我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he never kept any with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.04,1:31:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们尽管问吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ask me what you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.20,1:31:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会有任何隐瞒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There is nothing I shall hold back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.34,1:31:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说查尔斯爵士帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You have said Sir Charles helped you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.70,1:31:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当上了专职的打字员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to set yourself up as a professional typist, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.81,1:31:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概是在你丈夫弃你而去之后的事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}presumably that was after your husband deserted you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.94,1:31:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.06,1:32:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯爵士知道我父亲是不会帮我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Charles knew my father would not help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.37,1:32:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有件事情我得向您发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}One thing I swear to you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.59,1:32:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我写那封信的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when I wrote the letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.03,1:32:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}压根就没想要伤害那位老人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I never dreamed of any harm to the old gentleman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.49,1:32:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一直是我最仁慈的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}who had been my kindest friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.09,1:32:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我完全相信你 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I entirely believe you madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.17,1:32:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯爵士是不是请斯泰普顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And Sir Charles used Stapleton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.18,1:32:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出面做这件事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as an intermediary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.19,1:32:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他不想人们知道他的善行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He did not like to be seen to be doing good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.81,1:32:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在查尔斯爵士死亡的当天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And the letter that you sent to Sir Charles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.52,1:32:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你写给他的那封信呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on the day of his death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.00,1:32:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我离婚需要钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I needed money for my divorce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.83,1:32:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说他要去伦敦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I had heard he was leaving for London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.39,1:32:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寄信的主意是斯泰普顿出的吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And the sending of the letter was suggested by Stapleton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.59,1:32:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那封信是他口述的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He dictated it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.73,1:32:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的理由是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The reason he gave{\r}
