Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.74,1:43:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只不过是想要钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He simply wanted the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.66,1:43:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靴子的事情又是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What about the boot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.23,1:43:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他偷了靴子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He stole the boot presumably{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.95,1:43:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概是想要亨利爵士衣物中的一件物品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to have an article of Sir Henry's clothes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.48,1:43:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以让猎狗以此来追踪他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and to set the hound on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.91,1:43:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是为什么新靴子用不上的缘故{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That is why the new boot would not do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.68,1:43:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利爵士没有穿过它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Henry had not worn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.36,1:43:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 我们要迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson we are late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.82,1:43:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有两张去看「胡格诺派教徒」的票子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have tickets for Les Huguenots{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.49,1:43:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在卡文嘉顿上演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}at Cover Garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.02,1:44:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路上顺便去玛西尼餐厅用点晚餐如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A little dinner at Marcini's on the way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.38,1:44:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Wonderful Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.09,1:44:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卖报 卖报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Paper, paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.67,1:44:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁要晚报？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Who wants an evening paper?{\r}
